itten texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You make suggestions to talk about possible or necessary things to do.<br/><br/>You use the following expression to <span class = \"italic\">make suggestions</span> or <span class = \"italic\">offer a helpful idea</span>:<br/>- You could ... (possible)<br/><br/>You use the following expression to make a <span class = \"italic\">strong suggestion</span> or <span class = \"italic\">recommendation</span>:<br/>- You should ... (necessary)<br/> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: It's sunny and warm outside. We could go to the park. <br/><span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: Great idea!<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: There are dark clouds in the sky. It's about to rain. You should bring an umbrella.<br/><span class = \"strong\">Charlie</span>: Yes, mom!"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Saying Where Things are in a City"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use prepositions of place like <span class = \"italic\">at, in</span> and <span class = \"italic\">on</span> to talk about where things are."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class = \"strong\">at</span> when you talk about things <span class = \"strong\">at</span> a location<br/>Use <span class = \"strong\">in</span> when you talk about things <span class = \"strong\">in</span> a location.<br/>Use <span class = \"strong\">on</span> when you talk about things <span class = \"strong\">on</span> a location."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"4\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">at home<br/>at the dry cleaners\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">in the kitchen<br/>in the office\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">on the street<br/>on...Street/Avenue<br/>on the way\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: Where can someone fix my jacket?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: At the dry cleaners.<br/><span class = \"strong\">Anne</span>: Where is it?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: It's on Mercer Street."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cool"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a day that is not too hot and not too 